{"id":"e1876c63cf3f1fb2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-redex.md","title":"Redex","display":"df-redex — Redex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-redex","aliases":["72-df-redex"],"display":"df-redex — Redex","depends_on":["[[72-df-curry-howard]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, §3.3 print17–20; §11.6 print93","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-redex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-redex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-redex — Redex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, §3.3 print17–20; §11.6 print93"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a> 的证明语法与detour归约。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathcal D_s\">\\(d\\in\\mathcal D_s\\)</span> 是一个有限构造树；树地址为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(o\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，根为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span>。子树下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d|_o\">\\(d|_o\\)</span> 按构造的证明子项排序：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,I,E\">\\(i,I,E\\)</span> 各有一个证明子项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 有两个；类型注解不是证明子项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Pos}(a(x))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(i(x,A,d))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(I(U,d))&amp;:=\\operatorname{Pos}(E(d,A)):=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(e(d,e))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(e)\\},\\\\\nd|_{\\langle\\rangle}&amp;:=d,\\qquad c(d_0,\\ldots,d_{k-1})|_{\\langle j\\rangle^\\frown o}:=d_j|_o,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Redex}_\\to(d)&amp;:=\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d):\\exists x,A,e,f\\ (d|_o=e(i(x,A,e),f))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Redex}_F(d)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Redex}_\\to(d)\\cup\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d):\\exists U,e,B\\ (d|_o=E(I(U,e),B))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Detour}_s(o,d)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow o\\in\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d),\\qquad\\#\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=|\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d)|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Pos}(a(x))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(i(x,A,d))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(I(U,d))&amp;:=\\operatorname{Pos}(E(d,A)):=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(e(d,e))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(e)\\},\\\\\nd|_{\\langle\\rangle}&amp;:=d,\\qquad c(d_0,\\ldots,d_{k-1})|_{\\langle j\\rangle^\\frown o}:=d_j|_o,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Redex}_\\to(d)&amp;:=\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d):\\exists x,A,e,f\\ (d|_o=e(i(x,A,e),f))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Redex}_F(d)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Redex}_\\to(d)\\cup\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d):\\exists U,e,B\\ (d|_o=E(I(U,e),B))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Detour}_s(o,d)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow o\\in\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d),\\qquad\\#\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=|\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d)|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>范围明确为蕴含和二阶命题全称的introduction–elimination detour。其它连接词的归约不伪装成已定义的schema匹配。子树由地址递归给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-curry-howard]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的证明语法与detour归约。$d\\in\\mathcal D_s$ 是一个有限构造树；树地址为 $o\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}$，根为 $\\langle\\rangle$。子树下标 $d|_o$ 按构造的证明子项排序：$i,I,E$ 各有一个证明子项，$e$ 有两个；类型注解不是证明子项。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d\\in\\mathcal D_s","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"d|_o","display":false},{"tex":"i,I,E","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Pos}(a(x))&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(i(x,A,d))&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(I(U,d))&:=\\operatorname{Pos}(E(d,A)):=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(e(d,e))&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(e)\\},\\\\\nd|_{\\langle\\rangle}&:=d,\\qquad c(d_0,\\ldots,d_{k-1})|_{\\langle j\\rangle^\\frown o}:=d_j|_o,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Redex}_\\to(d)&:=\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d):\\exists x,A,e,f\\ (d|_o=e(i(x,A,e),f))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Redex}_F(d)&:=\\operatorname{Redex}_\\to(d)\\cup\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(d):\\exists U,e,B\\ (d|_o=E(I(U,e),B))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Detour}_s(o,d)&:\\Longleftrightarrow o\\in\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d),\\qquad\\#\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=|\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d)|.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2128,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-redex|df-redex — Redex]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-redex|df-redex — Redex]]"}],"outgoing":["4628a763a7cdff3f"]}